#: src/Privacy/PrivacyPolicy.php:44
msgid "This site uses UTM & Attribution Tracker to measure the performance of marketing campaigns. When you visit a page through a campaign link, the plugin records the campaign parameters (UTM values and advertising click IDs) from the URL, the address of the page you came from (referrer), your browser identification string (user agent), and a salted one-way hash of your IP address. The raw IP address is never stored, and the hash cannot be linked to you across other websites."
msgstr ""

